  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCORD Core Support 2023 - 2025 - To Enhance Multi-dimensional Approaches to Complex Conflicts in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core-support of ACCORD&#x2019;s five year strategy on enhancing collaboration and coordination towards improving the effectiveness of responses to address increasingly complex conflicts in the African continent. Enhancing the role of women to prevent, mitigate and resolve complex conflicts is one of the strategy objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
